    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d280-a1">

                <pb facs="0391" n="271" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg271"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Squiers to
                        the Secretary of State and Justice.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Habana,
                                Cuba</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-03-31"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 31,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency</hi>: Acting under particular
                    instructions from my government I have the honor to state to your excellency
                    that the people of the United States * * * between the two governments. (Quoted
                    from instruction No. 481, March 10, 1905. Printed ante.) * * *</p>
                <pb facs="0392" n="272" xml:id="pg272"/>
                <p>I inclose copy of a brief for the use of your excellency’s government, prepared
                    by R. Floyd Clarke, attorney for the McGivney &amp; Rokeby Construction Company,
                    and take this occasion to reiterate to your excellency the assurance, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. G. Squiers.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
